  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An elevator containing a load accelerates downward at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\ \\text{m s}^{-2}\"></span>. If the mass of the load is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span>, what is the magnitude of the normal force acting on the load?</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mg\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m(g - 2)\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m(g + 2)\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2m\"></span></p></li></ol>"
